  "details": "The new documentation (https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/playable-layers) has conflicting statements on where non-humanoid transform animations should be placed.\n\nUnder Gesture, it states: \"In addition, if you want to have an \"idle\" animation for non-humanoid bones like a tail, wings, ears, etc-- Gesture is where you should put it.\"\n\nBut in FX it states: \"everything that isn't a humanoid transform/muscle animation should go into the FX layer.\"\n\nSo where should non-humanoid transforms go? Gesture or FX?\n\nPlease clarify the documentation accordingly.",
